  "implementation": [
    "Actual independent source/profile/measurement editor buffers, original bytes, catalogs, JSON, decoded frames, options and capture Designer Origin children use checked current-capacity metadata.",
    "Finite Begin/stage/edit/cancel/reload/Apply candidates admit on the canonical budget before replacing the GUI owner. Coupled Apply admits the model and accepted Inputs/documents before committing either.",
    "Exclusive Retained::into_parts transfers the payload and covering reservation without releasing the charge. GUI fields drop data before guards; candidate/old/accepted/queued aliases overlap until actual final drop.",
    "Prepared Open/New models retain target guards through queueing and same-host GUI adoption without another reservation. New uses complete PreparedProject preparation before readiness/input/path reset, preserves appearance and reports admission failure through existing file feedback.",
    "Untouched measurement interval borrows named static text 1000; parsed owned text keeps its capacity charge. Saved JSON and numeric behavior remain identical. New/Save/recovery share the existing schema version as a named constant.",
    "The profile QObject is a thin Context/model/guard owner, preserving invokable signatures. Designer completion admits the edited measurement model; separate Designer Session/work/export owners remain pending.",
    "No public science/binding API, numerical implementation, dependency, registration or saved schema change. Legacy session::restore is test-only now that production New uses complete preparation."
  ],
